          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="testimonial-luxury-card glass-card">
          <div>
            <div class="stars-rating text-gold mb-3">
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-body" style="color: #F8FAFC !important;">"Their 16 years of expertise clearly shows. From 3D CAD modeling to the Spanish glass mosaic finish, everything was delivered turnkey with absolute professionalism."</p>
