          <div>
            <div class="stars-rating text-gold mb-3">
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-body" style="color: #F8FAFC !important;">"Outstanding commercial resort swimming pool engineering. The high-rate sand filtration pumps and zero-edge deck gutters keep the water crystal clear 24/7."</p>
